{"shortDescription":"Available With SMD or Through-Hole Mounting Options, Customizable Devices Offer Heat Rating Current to 30 A and High Operating Temperatures Up to +150 °CMALVERN, Pa., Sept. 01, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Vishay Intertechnology, Inc. NYSE:VSH today introduced two new low profile common mode chokes for…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"i","children":["Available With SMD or Through-Hole Mounting Options, Customizable Devices Offer Heat Rating Current to 30 A and High Operating Temperatures Up to +150 °C"]}]},{"type":"p","children":["MALVERN, Pa., Sept. 01, 2026 ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://www.globenewswire.com","linkText":"(GLOBE NEWSWIRE)"}}," -- Vishay Intertechnology, Inc. ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:VSH","text":"NYSE:VSH"}}," today introduced two new low profile common mode chokes for high current automotive, energy, and industrial applications. Available in both surface-mount and through-hole packages, the Vishay Dale commercial ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=Pa10GVuXr5GkiIzuKp9QOWeLQREIUAkGzxYvpC4A9DaMqERLm2TcKwoiVSyrzNQL_2NbegcMj-s-7EESRDEzUJGViidwSljKbkpitiEM9bk=","linkText":"ICMS2321-10"}}," and Automotive Grade ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=Pa10GVuXr5GkiIzuKp9QOej4HfQsc24ozvnhL9I-0RAP0jbwQ5Q_Bw5Fhj1xpb5MrMi1_4zJqeu45G-UDL1Gri7k3_VMR-ssP5xsVFA4bzo=","linkText":"ICMS2321-1A"}}," combine a heat rating current to 30 A with a 1500 VDC dielectric withstand voltage between coils."]},{"type":"p","children":["With their low profile, the devices released today offer a reduced size and volume, making them more resistant to shock and vibration, while their enhanced core design increases performance and saturation current at high temperatures up to +150 °C. Offering a self-shielded, rugged construction, the common mode chokes are ideal for DC/DC converters, high voltage inverters, EMI filters, and high current filters for noise suppression in motor control and other circuitry. The AEC-Q200 qualified ICMS2321-1A is well suited for use in automotive on-board chargers."]},{"type":"p","children":["In addition to their surface-mount and through-hole mounting options, the ICMS2321-10 and ICMS2321-1A offer customizable inductance, impedance, DCR, and current ratings. Devices with surface-mount terminations are available in tape and reel packaging and are compatible with automated pick and place assembly for increased flexibility in board layouts. The common mode chokes are RoHS-compliant, halogen-free, and Vishay Green."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":[{"type":"i","children":["Device Specification Table:"]}]}]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2},"children":[{"type":"b","children":["Part number"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["ICMS2321-10"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["ICMS2321-1A"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2},"children":[{"type":"b","children":["Inductance"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2},"children":["70 µH to 480 µH"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2},"children":[{"type":"b","children":["DCR typ."]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2},"children":["1.2 mΩ to 13.4 mΩ"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2},"children":[{"type":"b","children":["DCR max."]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2},"children":["1.3 mΩ to 15.0 mΩ"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"rowspan":3},"children":[{"type":"b","children":["Common mode "]}," ",{"t